<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Suchet Singh</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Suchet Singh was one of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dogras">Dogra</a> brothers who held powerful positions at the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lahore">Lahore</a> court of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sikh-empire">Sikh Empire</a>. With his brothers <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dhian-singh">Dhian Singh</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gulab-singh">Gulab Singh</a>, he took part in the court intrigues after <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ranjit-singh">Ranjit Singh</a>'s death. The Dogra faction manipulated the army.</p></div>
